---
title: ":pancakes: Apple Cinnamon Pancakes"
source: Recipe Box
servings: 4
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 10 minutes
total time: 20 minutes
tags:
  - breakfast
  - pancakes
  - apple
  - cinnamon
  - recipe-box
  - vegetarian
---

In a #mixing bowl{}, stir together dry @buckwheat pancake mix{3/4%cup}, @water{1/3%cup}, peeled, cored, and grated @apple{1%medium}, and @ground cinnamon{1%tsp}.

Coat a #skillet{} with cooking spray and heat over medium heat.

Ladle out batter in 2-3 Tbsp batches. Cook until browned on both sides, 2 to ~{3%minutes} per side.

Top with @pancake syrup{3%Tbsp} and sweetened @cinnamon applesauce{1%cup} and serve.
